# nr-office-pdf-render-paint: the paint stage of the page rasteriser of mixdog-pdf (src/render/)

Not compiled: cargo was not run (the lead compiles the wave). The unit tests and the twin test `twin_render_paint` were written
without being run, and the allowances of the twin test (tests/twin_render_paint.rs, `ALLOWANCES`) were chosen from the nature of
each kind of case, not measured: the first run may need them moved.

## Module lines

None. `mod pattern; mod shading; mod transparency;` are already in native/core/crates/mixdog-pdf/src/render/mod.rs (this task
edited that file: the render-core task that owns it is finished and nothing else in the wave owns it).

## Cargo

None. The task uses mixdog-raster (the tiny-skia types through `mixdog_raster::canvas::skia`), mixdog-js, serde_json and the
dev-dependencies the crate already has. No new crate, no new edge between workspace crates, no Cargo.lock change.

